      "type": "constructed_response",
      "stem_html": "<section class=\"exam-shared-context\">（一）必考题：</section><br>11. 如图，一不可伸长的细绳的上端固定，下端系在边长为<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/89536545970de6ffa43c.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">的正方形金属框的一个顶点上。金属框的一条对角线水平，其下方有方向垂直于金属框所在平面的匀强磁场。已知构成金属框的导线单位长度的阻值为<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/34aac6a14835c0e2d3d5.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">；在<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/9adafbc77f0fd0066ae3.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">到<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/35dd41b910845b973d76.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">时间内，磁感应强度大小随时间t的变化关系为<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/b367587994241f6401ae.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">。求:<br>（1）<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/e9bdc0c903326adcc995.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">时金属框所受安培力的大小；<br>（2）在<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/9adafbc77f0fd0066ae3.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">到<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/e9bdc0c903326adcc995.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">时间内金属框产生的焦耳热。<br><img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-figure-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/f3aeb22d9aebb211b64d.png\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">",
